<title>UK: Bulker with wheat refloated off Trabzon, Turkey.</title>
<headline>Bulker with wheat refloated off Trabzon, Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish-flag bulker Mine K, carrying a cargo of wheat was refloated off Trabzon, Turkey, on March 17, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 17,802 dwt vessel had drifted at anchor and run aground.</p>
